"""Data for make-wave7.py: what to add per game (poses, 3D variety, art variety). Own names only; no original-game names.

Characters: (id, name-in-prompt desc, act phrase, kind, tier, flags)
  kind  fb = full body standing | fl = floating / hovering (no feet line) | bu = bust (head and shoulders)
  tier  boss | main | side      -> pose count and priority
  flags m = also walks (walk-a, walk-b)   g = magenta key (green subject)   r:<path> = reference painting (relative to repo)
Objects with a pose list: (id, desc, [(pose, phrase)], pri, flags)
3D items: (item, desc, piece?, pri, why, reference painting or '')
Art items: (stem, desc, ratio, size, pri, why, cutout?)   ratio 16:9 / 9:16 / 4:3 / 3:4 / 1:1
"""

